cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ferryGL in your work, please cite the white paper below."
title: ferryGL
abstract: >-
  ferryGL is token-free automation: it copies the GitHub issues and pull requests a person
  is part of, one way, into their own Linear workspace, using only their own credentials,
  and keeps their status in step with GitHub, without running an AI model. AI agents can
  run it instead of doing the job themselves.
type: software
authors:
